    query: 'saas spend audit use cases',
    body: 'Where the audit pays off: pre-renewal reviews, onboarding and offboarding, post-merger cleanup, quarterly finance reporting, and ongoing tool-sprawl control. The job is the same in every case — make overlap and forgotten tools visible and repeatable.',
    refs: ['https://saaspend.lxsaihub.com/blog/saas-spend-audit-use-cases'],
