        <title>{`${PRODUCT.name} — Blog`}</title>
        <meta name="description" content="Definitional and how-to posts on SaaS spend audits — what they are, how to run one, common mistakes, tool comparisons, and use cases for SMB ops and finance managers tracking tool sprawl." />
      </Head>
      <div className="max-w-3xl">
        <div className="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-indigo-600 mb-3">Blog · GEO</div>
        <h1 className="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">SaaS spend audits, explained</h1>
        <p className="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-10">Own the definitional queries teams ask before they cut redundant SaaS — what an audit is, how to run one, and where the savings estimate comes from.</p>

        <div className="space-y-8">
